  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You entreat your patron to grant you a small wish. As a Magic action, you can speak your desire to your Genie's Vessel, requesting the effect of one spell of level 6 or lower that has a casting time of an action. The spell can be from any class's spell list, and you don't need to meet its requirements, including costly components; the spell simply takes effect as part of this action. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish 1d4 Long Rests.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-O8cxesG5WzUrq3sE\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll the number of Long Rests, then restore the use yourself once they are done.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
